Scrolls of enchant weapon were rare in my current Samurai game.
So I carried a bunch of swords with me for deadly two-weaponing,
none enchanted but the plain (non-artifact) ones from the Quest
(that usually are rustproof or greased and often are at +2/+3).

In the past I fought either with Excalibur/+3 longsword, or with
Grayswandir/+3 longsword. Longswords at Expert, Sabres at Basic,
and two-weaponing at Expert are already at maximum proficiency.

