scroll of enchant weapon, and a lucky full-ID of inventory showed
me most of my weapon's enchantments I am pondering what weapon
to preferably enchant; scrolls are rare, as said, and I found my
first and only magic marker not before Orcus' town. The available
weapons (modulo the Tsurugi and the Werebane that are in a stash)
are:

the blessed rustproof +0 Excalibur (weapon in hand)
the +0 Grayswandir
a greased +3 katana (wielded in other hand)
an uncursed katana named Snickersnee
a +3 long sword
a blessed long sword named Fire Brand
an uncursed thoroughly rusty corroded long sword named Sunsword

I wrote 2 blessed scrolls of EW and have another uncursed one
available to spend. Since my Samurai has already visited most of
